  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Healing energy radiates from you in an aura with a 30-foot radius. Until the spell ends, the aura moves with you, centered on you. You can use a bonus action to cause one creature in the aura (including you) to regain 2d6 hit points.</p>\n<p><strong>midi-qol</strong>: No macros required. Two activities: \"Enable Aura\" (consumes spell slot, applies the Aura of Vitality effect) and \"Heal Target\" (bonus action, 2d6 healing, only usable while the aura effect is active via useConditionText).</p>",
